@dungeon Shadowfang Keep
@levels 22-30
@window 21-28
@best 23
@hub Silverpine Forest, 43.4, 40.9, 6
@entrance Silverpine Forest, 44.8, 67.8
A 1013 @ Undercity, 53.7, 54.5 | Keeper Bel'dugur in the Apothecarium. The Book of Ur is on a bookshelf near the end of the keep.
A 1098 @ Silverpine Forest, 43.4, 40.9 | High Executor Hadrec at the Sepulcher. It ends inside the keep, at Deathstalker Vincent.
A 1014 @ Silverpine Forest, 44.2, 39.8 | Dalar Dawnweaver at the Sepulcher. Kill Arugal, the last boss.
RUN | The keep is in the south of Silverpine, on the hill above Pyrewood Village: follow the road south from the Sepulcher. Hand Deathstalkers in Shadowfang in to Deathstalker Vincent inside.
T 1014 @ Silverpine Forest, 44.2, 39.8
T 1013 @ Undercity, 53.7, 54.5
